{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38922","headline":"晚春寄同年张曙先辈 · 杜荀鹤","name":"晚春寄同年张曙先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫将时态破天真，祗合高歌醉过春。\n易落好花三个月，难留浮世百年身。\n无金润屋浑闲事，有酒扶头是了人。\n恩地未酬闲未得，一回醒话一沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}